                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I worked with the devs as a PR guy for a bit on this game and I liked where it was going, great team.. but there's nothing here; not even a tutorial, you have to go to a Google Docs document to learn what to do, just a hassle on that could be fixed with a quick patch. There hasn't been any updates for 2 months either, just makes me think they've given up on it. However, there is potential and I look forward to when it comes, if it comes.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1455376095,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1455376095,
