                        "steam_purchase": false,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": true,
                        "developer_response": "Hey Razor,\n\nI appreciate you being critical and would like to state that the game has been improved significantly since our early alpha builds, we are more dedicated to the project than ever with an increased team size and we would really appreciate a re-evaluation, be sure to check out the beta build and the update related post:\n\nBeta Post: http://steamcommunity.com/games/412250/announcements/detail/790768458688459519",
